OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK council group forms
OL,4,Ashadow cabinet
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's group leader said its
OL,7,Fshadow cabinet would make sure
OL,8,F"Plymouth residents' voices are heard".
OL,10,FCouncillor Steve Ricketts said 10
OL,11,Fmembers of Reform's Plymouth City
OL,12,FCouncil group had been selected to take
OL,13,Fresponsibility for key areas of policy
OL,14,Fincluding health, finance and housing.
OL,16,FHe said the shadow cabinet would be
OL,17,Fabout more than "simply opposing
OL,18,FLabour", who has control of the
OL,19,Fauthority.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
