OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK council group forms
OL,4,Ashadow cabinet
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform gained 14 seats at May's local
OL,7,Felections in Plymouth, adding to the
OL,8,Ftwo they already had, but since then,
OL,9,Fcouncillor Carol Ney has resigned from
OL,10,Fthe party and become independent, the
OL,11,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service said.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
